flowchart TB
    A[Inbound message with N request elements] --> B[Parse into list of N requests]
    B --> C[Foreach request in list]
    C --> D[HTTP.Request Task\ncall SimpleStockQuoteService]
    D --> E[Collect response into results list]
    E --> F{More items?}
    F -->|Yes| C
    F -->|No| G[Aggregate all N responses\ninto one combined result]
    G --> H[Return combined response]
